INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (21, 'Daraz', 550.0, 'https://www.daraz.com.bd/products/biocare-handmade-papaya-pureglow-beauty-soap-bar-i525345196.html', 'BioCare Handmade Papaya PureGlow Beauty Soap Bar', 'BioCare Handmade Papaya PureGlow Beauty Soap Bar Active ingredients : Papaya Extract Volume: 100 gm Reveal Your Natural Radiance with Papaya''s Gentle TouchExperience the natural benefits of papaya with our BioCare Handmade Papaya PureGlow Beauty Bar. Infused with papaya extract, this bar gently exfoliates, fades dark spots, and brightens your skin, leaving it smooth, moisturized, and refreshedBenefitBrightens Skin: Even out your skin tone with the power of papaya extract, leaving you with a radiant glow.Gentle Exfoliation: The papain enzyme exfoliates your skin, removing dead cells for a smoother, more refined texture.Even Skin Tone: Helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and hyperpigmentation, promoting a balanced and uniform complexion.Moisturizes After Bath: Unlike other soaps, this beauty bar hydrates your skin, keeping it soft and smooth long after use.Feature100% Natural Ingredients: No harsh chemicals or artificial fragrances.Suitable for All Skin Types: Gentle enough for sensitive skin, ideal for daily use.Moisturizing Formula: Keeps skin hydrated and nourished.Cruelty-Free: No animal testing involved in the making of this product.Unveil radiant, youthful skin with the BioCare Handmade Papaya PureGlow Beauty Bar. Formulated with natural papaya extract, this soap is your ultimate skincare companion. The papain enzyme in papaya works as a gentle exfoliator, sloughing off dead skin cells and revealing a smoother, brighter complexion. Packed with Vitamin A, this beauty bar offers remarkable anti-aging properties, helping to reduce the visibility of fine lines and wrinkles.This powerful yet gentle soap works wonders on dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tones. The natural papaya extract gradually fades these imperfections, promoting a more even and luminous complexion. With each use, your skin will feel deeply moisturized, refreshed, and rejuvenated, leaving it irresistibly soft and glowing.For all skin types, even sensitive skin, BioCare Papaya PureGlow Beauty Bar is the natural way to restore your skin’s youthful radiance without harsh chemicals.Active/Main Ingredients:• Papaya Extract: Rich in papain, a natural enzyme that promotes gentle exfoliation, reduces dark spots, and brightens the skin and vitamin A to fades fine lines and wrinkles for a youthful skin.HOW TO USEGently rub the BioCare Papaya PureGlow Beauty Bar between your hands or directly onto your skin during your bath or shower to create a luxurious lather. For a richer foamy experience, use a loofah or bath sponge. Apply to your body and face, then rinse off with water. Enjoy softer, more radiant skin after each use!Volume: 100 gm', 'Bio-Xin Cosmeceuticals', 100.0, 1);
