INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (23, 'Daraz', 544.0, 'https://www.daraz.com.bd/products/biocare-handmade-niacinamide-brightening-beauty-bar-i526621747.html', 'BioCare Handmade Niacinamide Brightening Beauty Bar', 'BioCare Handmade Niacinamide Brightening Beauty Bar Active ingredients : Niacinamide Glow brighter and smoother with the gentle touch of NiacinamideBioCare Handmade Niacinamide Brightening Beauty Bar brightens, hydrates, and smooths skin with Niacinamide. It helps to reduce dark spots, irritation, and excess oil. Perfect for all skin types.BenefitBrightening: Enhances skin radiance by reducing dullness and restoring a natural glow.Evens the Skin Tone: Helps fade dark spots and discoloration for a more uniform complexion.Moisturizing After Bath: Locks in hydration to keep skin soft, smooth, and nourished.Repairs Sun Tan: Soothes and revitalizes sun-exposed skin, reducing tan and damage.Anti-Aging Effect: Hydrates and firms the skin, minimizing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.FeatureMade NaturallySuitable for All Types of SkinGentle Sensitive SkinNo Harsh ChemicalReveal your natural glow with BioCare Handmade Niacinamide Brightening Beauty Bar, crafted to brighten, hydrate, and smooth your skin. Enriched with Niacinamide, it helps to reduce dark spots, control excess oil, and soothe irritation for a balanced complexion. This gentle yet effective formula boosts hydration, leaving your skin soft, smooth, and radiant. Made with natural ingredients and free from harsh chemicals, it''s safe for even the most sensitive skin. Enjoy a refreshing and moisturizing skincare experience every day!Ingredients Wise BenefitNiacinamide : Inhibits melanin transfer , Anti-inflammatory , Increases skin hydration , Anti-acne (Excessive oil)HOW TO USE : Gently rub the Bar between hands or directly on skin to create a lather. For a richer, more foaming effect, use loofah.Active ingredients :NiacinamideVolume: 100 gm', 'Bio-Xin Cosmeceuticals', 100.0, 1);
