INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (24, 'Daraz', 649.0, 'https://www.daraz.com.bd/products/biocare-hair-growth-oil-i526629444.html', 'BioCare Hair Growth Oil', 'BioCare Hair Growth Oil Active ingredients : Fractionated Coconut Oil Onion Oil Baobab Oil Pomegranate Seed Oil Argan Oil Rosemary Oil Black Pepper Oil Castor Oil Vitamin-E Oil Stronger and shinier hair starts with BioCare Hair Growth OilBioCare Hair Growth Oil nourishes the scalp with a blend of natural oils, promoting healthy hair growth and reducing hair fall. It strengthens and moisturizes, leaving hair soft and shiny. Perfect for boosting thickness and overall hair health.BenefitIncreases Hair Growth: Provides essential nutrients to the scalp, promoting healthier and stronger hair growth.Reduces Hair Fall: Strengthens hair roots and minimizes breakage for thicker, fuller hair.Deep Nourishment: Hydrates and revitalizes the scalp and hair, keeping them soft, smooth, and healthy.FeatureNatural Ingredients: Made with a blend of 100% natural oilsLightweight Formula: The hair oil is remarkably light, ensuring it doesn''t weigh your hair downQuick Absorption: Quickly absorbs into hair follicles for faster, more effective results.Suitable for All Hair Types: Works effectively on straight, wavy, or curly hair textures.No Harsh Chemicals: Free from harsh chemicals, ensuring it is gentle on the scalp.Portable and Travel-Friendly: The bottle is compact and easy to carry, making it perfect for travel.BioCare Hair Growth Oil is a powerful blend of natural oils that work together to boost hair growth and reduce hair fall. Enriched with Fractionated Coconut Oil, Onion Oil, and Baobab Oil, it deeply nourishes your scalp, promoting healthier hair from root to tip. The addition of Pomegranate Seed Oil and Argan Oil provides moisture, leaving your hair soft and shiny. Rosemary and Black Pepper Oils help stimulate circulation to the scalp, while Castor and Vitamin E Oils strengthen and protect each strand. Ideal for anyone looking to improve hair thickness and overall health.Ingredients Wise Benefit:1. Fractionated Coconut Oi: Deeply moisturizes the hair and scalp.2. Onion Oil: Helps reduce hair fall and boosts hair growth.3. Baobab Oil: Hydrates and nourishes the hair, leaving it smooth, shiny, and manageable.4. Pomegranate Seed Oil: Strengthens hair roots, reducing breakage and promoting healthier growth.5. Argan Oil: Makes the hair more soft, shiny, and manageable.6. Rosemary Oil: Reduces hair fall and thickens the hair.7. Black Pepper Oil: Increases blood circulation in the scalp, enhancing nutrient delivery to hair follicles.8. Castor Oil: Increases scalp circulation while promoting hair growth. 9. Vitamin E Oil: Nourishes, moisturizes, and protects the hair from environmental damage, improving overall texture.HOW TO USE : 1. Take 2-3 drops of the oil in your hand palm.2. Gently massage the oil into the roots and all over the hair for at least 5-10 minutes to stimulate blood flow.3. Leave the oil at least for 2-3 hours.4. Shampoo your hair thoroughly to remove the oil.5. Use the oil 3-4 times a week for optimal results.Active ingredients :Fractionated Coconut OilOnion OilBaobab OilPomegranate Seed OilArgan OilRosemary OilBlack Pepper OilCastor OilVitamin-E OilVolume: 50 ml', 'Bio-Xin Cosmeceuticals', 100.0, 1);
