INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (27, 'Daraz', 1099.0, 'https://www.daraz.com.bd/products/biocare-niacinamide-brightening-serum-i530559112.html', 'BioCare Niacinamide Brightening Serum', 'BioCare Niacinamide Brightening Serum Active ingredients : Niacinamide Tranexamic Acid Vitamin B 12 Hyaluronic Acid Bright Skin Begins with NiacinamideBioCare Niacinamide Brightening Serum combines Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, Vitamin B12, and Hyaluronic Acid to brighten, hydrate, and even out skin tone. This lightweight, fast-absorbing formula helps reduce dark spots and enhances skin smoothness for a glowing, radiant complexion.BenefitSkin Brightening: Visibly brightens dull skin by reducing dark spots and enhancing natural radianceEvens Out Skin Tone: Helps fade pigmentation and discoloration for a more uniform, balanced complexionHydrating: Deeply nourishes and hydrates the skin, restoring moisture balance for a healthy, glowing, and plump-looking complexionRevitalizes Skin: Re-energizes tired, dull-looking skin for a youthful, vibrant glowImproves Skin Texture: Refines skin surface and minimizing pore appearance and roughness, leaving skin smoothFeatureLightweight Texture: Feels featherlight on the skin for comfortable daily useFast-Absorbing Formula: Instantly penetrates the skin for a smooth, fresh feel without any greasy aftereffectNon-Sticky Finish: Leaves skin smooth and fresh, never sticky or tackySuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle and effective for oily, dry, combination, and sensitive skinGentle, Skin-Friendly Formula: Designed to nourish without irritation or harsh effectsBioCare Niacinamide Brightening Serum is a powerful yet lightweight formula designed to brighten, hydrate, and improve skin tone. Infused with Niacinamide to even out skin tone, Tranexamic Acid to fade hyperpigmentation, and Vitamin B12 to promote smoother skin, this serum delivers visible results. Hyaluronic Acid boosts hydration and locks in moisture for plumper skin. It improves texture, minimizes the appearance of pores, and controls oiliness for a balanced complexion. The non-greasy, quick-absorbing formula works well under makeup or as part of your evening skincare routine. It also revitalizes dull, tired-looking skin, making it appear more energized and livelier. With regular use, it targets dark spots, reduces discoloration, and helps reveal a glowing, smooth complexion, leaving your skin brighter and healthier.Ingredients Wise BenefitNiacinamide: Brightens up the skin, repairs skin texture, and visibly improves uneven skin tone.Tranexamic Acid: Fights dark spots and hyperpigmentation while reducing skin inflammation.Vitamin B 12: Enhances skin renewal, fades dark spots, and improves overall skin smoothness.Hyaluronic Acid: Provides deep hydration, plumps the skin, and boosts absorption of active ingredientsHOW TO USE : After cleansing, apply a few drops of serum to your face and neck. Gently massage until fully absorbed. Use twice daily—morning and night—for best brightening and hydrating results.Volume: 30 mL', 'Bio-Xin Cosmeceuticals', 100.0, 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (row_id, product_name, brand_name, size, manufactured_price, market_average_price, canonical_name) VALUES (28, 'BioCare Acne & Oil Control Sunscreen Moisturizer SPF 60+', 'BioCare', '40g', 1199.25, 1599.0, '');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (28, 'Daraz', 1599.0, 'https://www.daraz.com.bd/products/biocare-acne-oil-control-sunscreen-moisturizer-spf-60-i529991861.html', 'BioCare Acne & Oil Control Sunscreen Moisturizer SPF 60+', 'BioCare Acne & Oil Control Sunscreen Moisturizer SPF 60+ Active ingredients : Aloe Vera Leaf Extract Tea Tree Oil Betaine Salicylate Vitamin E Hyaluronic Acid UVA and UVB Filters Two-in-One Solution: High Sun Protection and Moisturization for Oily and Acne-Prone Skin.Experience dual action care with Bio Care Acne & Oil Control Sunscreen SPF 60+, advanced sun protection and deep moisturization in one. Specially designed for oily, acne-prone skin, it shields against UVA, UVB, and blue light while controlling oil and soothing acne breakouts. Lightweight, non-greasy, and perfect for daily use..BenefitHigh Sun Protection: Provides complete protection from UVA, UVB, and blue light to help prevent sun damage, uneven skin tone, and early signs of aging.Moisturization: Hydrates the skin effectively without making it greasy, keeping it soft and supple throughout the day.Controls Excess Oil: Regulates oil production for a long-lasting matte finish, ideal for oily and acne-prone skin.Prevents Acne: Formulated with acne-fighting ingredients, it reducing acne and controls acne breakouts and keep pores clear.FeatureLightweight Formula: Feels ultra-light and breathable, perfect for oily and acne-prone skin.Non-Sticky Finish: Absorbs without leaving any greasy or heavy residue.Smooth Texture: Spreads easily and evenly for a soft, flawless feel.Fast-Absorbing: Quickly sinks into the skin, delivering instant hydration and protection.Comfortable Wear: Keeps skin fresh, protected, and moisturized all day.Bio Care Acne & Oil Control Sunscreen Moisturizer SPF 60+ is your all-in-one defense against sun damage, excess oil, and acne. Powered by SPF 60+, it shields your skin from UVA, UVB, and blue light to help prevent tanning, dark spots, and early aging. This lightweight formula moisturizes and hydrates without clogging pores—thanks to Hyaluronic Acid—while Aloe Vera and Licorice Extract calm irritation. Tea Tree Oil fights acne-causing bacteria, and Betaine Salicylate gently exfoliates, clears pores, and helps reduce excess oil production. Vitamin E adds antioxidant benefits and is also considered as natural sun protector. Fast-absorbing and non-greasy, it leaves your skin fresh, matte, and perfectly protected all day.Ingredients Wise BenefitAloe Vera Leaf Extract: Soothes inflammation, hydrates, and heals.Tea Tree Oil: Natural antibacterial; controls acne-breakout.Betaine Salicylate: Mild exfoliator, suitable for sensitive skin; prevents clogged pores and smooths skin texture.Vitamin E: Powerful antioxidant and natural sun protector.Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate: Derived from licorice root extract; calms redness and irritation.Hyaluronic Acid: Deeply hydrates the skin without making it greasy.UVA and UVB Filters: Provides broad-spectrum protection against UVA, UVB and blue rays, helping prevent sunburn, pigmentation, and premature skin aging.HOW TO USE : Apply a generous amount of sunscreen evenly to all exposed skin areas 20 to 30 minutes before sun exposure for maximum UVA, UVB and blue light protection.Volume: 40g', 'Bio-Xin Cosmeceuticals', 100.0, 1);
