INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (71, 'OhSoGo', 830.0, 'https://www.ohsogo.com/products/guerniss-raw-rosemerry-face-body-oil-100ml', 'Guerniss Raw Rosemerry Face & Body Oil (100ml)', 'Guerniss Raw Rosemerry Face & Body Oil (100ml) <h2><br></h2>
<p>Indulge your skin in the invigorating, aromatic goodness of <strong>Guerniss Raw Rosemary Face &amp; Body Oil (100ml)</strong> a premium, multi-purpose botanical oil enriched with the powerful properties of <strong>Rosemary</strong> to deeply nourish, revitalize, and protect both face and body. Rosemary is celebrated in skincare for its potent antioxidant, anti-inflammatory, and circulation-boosting properties making this versatile oil the perfect daily treatment for skin that looks and feels healthy, firm, and beautifully radiant.</p>
<p>Buy <strong>Guerniss Raw Rosemary Face &amp; Body Oil at the best price in online</strong>,</p>
<h3>Key Benefits</h3>
<ul>
<li>Rich in Rosemary extract a potent antioxidant that protects skin from free radical damage and premature ageing</li>
<li>Deeply nourishes and moisturizes both face and body for soft, supple, and hydrated skin</li>
<li>Boosts circulation to promote a healthy, natural glow and more even skin tone</li>
<li>Anti-inflammatory properties help soothe redness, irritation, and sensitive skin</li>
<li>Helps firm and tone skin for a more youthful, lifted appearance</li>
<li>Lightweight, fast-absorbing formula that leaves no greasy residue</li>
<li>Versatile multi-purpose oil suitable for face, body, and hair</li>
</ul>
<h3>Why Choose Guerniss Raw Rosemary Face &amp; Body Oil?</h3>
<p>Guerniss Raw’s <strong>Rosemary Face &amp; Body Oil</strong> harnesses the full botanical power of rosemary in a luxurious, lightweight oil that works for your entire body. Whether you use it as a daily facial oil, a body moisturizer, a massage oil, or a hair treatment, this versatile oil delivers deep nourishment, antioxidant protection, and a refreshing, invigorating rosemary scent that awakens the senses and leaves your skin glowing.</p>
<h3>How to Use</h3>
<p><strong>For Face:</strong> Apply 2–3 drops to clean face and neck. Gently pat and press into skin until absorbed. Use morning and/or evening after serum, before SPF (daytime).<br><strong>For Body:</strong> Apply generously to clean, dry or damp skin. Massage in circular motions until fully absorbed. Focus on dry areas such as elbows, knees, and heels.<br><strong>For Hair:</strong> Apply a few drops to scalp and hair. Massage gently and leave on for 30 minutes before washing, or use as a leave-in treatment on dry ends.</p>
<p><strong>Volume:</strong> 100ml | <strong>Brand:</strong> Guerniss | <strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> Rosemary</p>', 'Guerniss', 72.33, 1);
