INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (row_id, product_name, brand_name, size, manufactured_price, market_average_price, canonical_name) VALUES (91, 'Guerniss Full Cover Matte Foundation (1.0 Porcelain)', 'Guerniss', '30ml', 1122.0, 1870.0, 'Full Cover Matte Foundation (30ml) 1.0 Porcelain');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (91, 'Guerniss Official', 1683.0, 'https://guerniss.com/products/full-cover-matte-foundation', 'Full Cover Matte Foundation (30ml) 1.0 Porcelain', 'Full Cover Matte Foundation (30ml) 1.0 Porcelain <p>The <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/r/1JzN2GQrdq/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Guerniss Full Cover Matte Foundation</strong></a> is expertly designed for those seeking a <strong>full coverage matte foundation</strong> without the weight. This advanced formula blends mattifying agents with nourishing extracts to ensure your complexion remains smooth, even, and shine-free throughout the day. It also features built-in sun protection with Octinoxate (3%) and Titanium Dioxide (1.6%), shielding your skin from harmful UV rays while giving a flawless finish. The combination makes it a top choice in the category for daily wear.</p>
<p>Ideal for a wide range of skin types, this lightweight is effective in hiding imperfections and blemishes. It maintains natural skin breathability while offering powerful coverage and a soft matte finish. Users seeking a <strong>full coverage </strong>that feels light on the skin will find this product to be an excellent match.</p>
<h2>Features and Benefits of Guerniss Matte Foundation</h2>
<p>Guerniss Full Cover Matte Foundation enriches your skin with hydrating, soothing, and antioxidant-rich ingredients. Elements like Shea Butter, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), and Laminaria Saccharina Extract work together to maintain healthy skin and prevent dryness. This <strong>medium coverage foundation</strong> balances hydration with the matte effect, offering a glowing yet shine-free appearance.</p>
<p>Specially formulated for daily use, this foundation provides lasting hydration and oil control. It stands among the options. Its unique base and texture enhancers allow for smooth, even application without caking or uneven patches, ensuring flawless wear all day long.</p>
<h3>Key Ingredients &amp; Benefits of This Matte Foundation</h3>
<h4>Active Ingredients</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Octinoxate (3.0%) &amp; Titanium Dioxide (1.6%)</strong> – These ingredients provide broad-spectrum UV protection. They help prevent sun damage and premature skin aging while maintaining the protective properties.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Base &amp; Texture Enhancers</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Dimethicone &amp; Trimethylsiloxysilicate</strong> – These components create a smooth, silky application with long-lasting moisture retention and wear.</li>
<li>
<strong>Disteardimonium Hectorite &amp; Polyglyceryl-3 Disostearate</strong> – Help stabilize the texture for an even, flawless finish.</li>
<li>
<strong>Mica, Iron Oxides (CI 77491, 77492, 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)</strong> – Provide natural, buildable color with a soft matte finish, which suits different skin tones well.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Moisturizers &amp; Skin Conditioners</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</strong> – This deeply hydrates and nourishes the skin, preventing dryness and maintaining softness.</li>
<li>
<strong>Glycerin &amp; Butylene Glycol</strong> – Attract moisture to the skin, keeping it plump and refreshed throughout the day.</li>
<li>
