<ul>
<li>Hydrates and nourishes skin for a soft, dewy finish.</li>
<li>Lightweight, oil-free formula perfect for daily use.</li>
<li>Smooths and evens skin tone naturally for a flawless look.</li>
<li>Can be used as a primer or a light coverage base.</li>
<li>Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and dry skin.</li>
</ul>
<h3>🌿 Key Ingredients for Effective Skin Care</h3>
<p>The formula contains powerful ingredients like <strong>Ginseng Root Extract</strong>, <strong>Tilia Cordata Wood Extract</strong>, <strong>Wheat Protein</strong>, and <strong>Yeast Extract</strong>. These antioxidants and skin conditioners revitalize and protect your skin from daily environmental stress.</p>
<p>Each ingredient plays an important role:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Ginseng Root Extract</strong> boosts skin elasticity and brightness.</li>
<li>
<strong>Tilia Cordata Wood Extract</strong> soothes and calms irritated skin effectively.</li>
<li>
<strong>Wheat Protein</strong> nurtures and strengthens the skin barrier deeply.</li>
<li>
<strong>Yeast Extract</strong> supports skin repair while adding antioxidant protection.</li>
</ul>
<h3>How to Use </h3>
<p>For optimal results, apply a small amount to clean, moisturized skin. Blend evenly using your fingers, a sponge, or a brush. The cream absorbs quickly, making it ideal for busy mornings. Use it alone for a natural glow or under makeup for fuller coverage.</p>
<p>Thanks to its gentle, mineral-infused composition, it is suitable for daily wear in both summer and winter. The versatile formulation is highly recommended for balancing skincare and makeup needs effectively.</p>
