<p data-start="374" data-end="703">This makes it one of the best face powder options for people with oily or combination skin. At the same time, it remains gentle and comfortable for dry and sensitive skin types.</p>
<p data-start="705" data-end="995">The formula is designed to blur imperfections and even out skin tone. It helps minimize the appearance of pores, fine lines, and minor blemishes. As a result, your skin looks smoother and more refined instantly. This best ensures your makeup stays fresh and intact for hours.</p>
<p data-start="997" data-end="1312">Guerniss has carefully crafted this product with skin-friendly ingredients. The inclusion of oil-controlling minerals helps maintain a shine-free finish. Meanwhile, nourishing extracts keep your skin feeling soft and breathable. Unlike many heavy powders, this pressed formula does not clog pores or cause cakiness.</p>
<p data-start="1314" data-end="1563">Another advantage of this is its versatility. You can use it alone for a natural everyday look. It also works beautifully over foundation to set your makeup. Its compact design makes it easy to carry, allowing quick touch-ups anytime.</p>
<p data-start="1565" data-end="1840">If you are searching for, this product is a reliable choice. It delivers long-lasting performance while keeping your skin comfortable. The lightweight texture ensures you never feel weighed down. Instead, you enjoy a smooth and radiant finish all day.</p>
<p data-start="1842" data-end="2157" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Overall, <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/r/1DtvthTxfv/" target="_blank" title="" rel="noopener">Guerniss Pro Perfect</a> combines performance and comfort in one product. It controls oil, blurs imperfections, and enhances your natural beauty. This pressed powder is ideal for daily wear and on-the-go use. With consistent use, your skin appears more polished, fresh, and confidently flawless.</p> 12g 12ml', 'Guerniss', 100.0, 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (row_id, product_name, brand_name, size, manufactured_price, market_average_price, canonical_name) VALUES (106, 'G/S Liquid Concealer (GO21 - Honey)', 'Guerniss', '7ml', 948.0, 1580.0, 'Full Coverage Liquid Concealer 7 ml G021- HONEY');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (106, 'Guerniss Official', 1422.0, 'https://guerniss.com/products/full-coverage-liquid-concealer', 'Full Coverage Liquid Concealer 7 ml G021- HONEY', 'Full Coverage Liquid Concealer 7 ml G021- HONEY <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Full Coverage liquid concealer is the type of concealer that comes in a liquid formula and gives a high coverage finish. It can have different types of containers and applicators. Concealers come in various shades as the foundation. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Though we should always purchase foundation accurately matched to the skin, we can purchase concealers one or two shades brighter or darker than the skin tone. We generally choose brighter shades to highlight the areas and we use darker shades to correct the dark spots or patches.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Concealers help to hide all the imperfections for example:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">pimples</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">dark spots</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">dark circles</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Melasma</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rosacea</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Fine lines</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Wrinkles</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Hyper pigmentations</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you are going for a natural look you can only use concealer to do a full face makeover. Full coverage concealers are generally a good substitute for foundation in your makeup routine.</span></p>
<h1><a href="https://youtube.com/shorts/lTRnyMnvys8?si=1NRqlKFW3wTIeuWx" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Guerniss Full Coverage Liquid Concealer </strong></a></h1>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This concealer is a high coverage lightweight liquid concealer which comes in a jar with a doe foot applicator. It comes in three different shades that cover almost all skin tones. The concealer is very lightweight and also doesn’t get cakey at all. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">It has buildable coverage that leaves the skin with a bright and radiant finish. It also does not contain any artificial fragrance. It is very easily blendable. You can blend it with your finger, brush or beauty sponge.</span></p>
<h2><strong>More about <a href="https://youtube.com/shorts/z_MUrrTvEqI?si=h5S5PTzcQjuAh_5M" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Full Coverage liquid concealer</a></strong></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The concealer gives a satin finish, doesn’t reflect light and also makes you camera ready.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Only one to two drops is enough for covering your whole face. Besides the concealer is very hydrating and doesn’t dry out the skin. It lasts up to 16 hours and also doesn’t move at all. Moreover it gives a matte finish and instantly wakes the skin up.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The product is crease-proof, waterproof, vegan and also cruelty-free and great for all types of skin.</span></p>
<p> </p> 7g 7ml', 'Guerniss', 97.79, 0);
