<div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main">
<p><strong>What it is:</strong></p>
<p>Mascara enhances the eyes in a number of ways. It not only darkens lashes, but can lengthen and volumize them for brighter, bigger-looking eyes. Fuller-looking lashes can help to give a more youthful appearance to the eye area.</p>
<p><br><strong>What it does:</strong></p>
<p><br>Guerniss Lashfull Mascara is formulated as an all-in-one mascara, combining volume, length, and definition for the maximum lash effect. It''s created with a special combination of waxes which will amplify your lashes while leaving it smooth and flexible. If you desire for full lengthening or curled lashes, ours is a super attractive mascara for you. It''s also lightweight, fragrance-free, and humidity-resistant. This is a paraben and cruelty-free product.</p>
<p><img style="width: 892px; height: 892px;" src="https://www.guerniss.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Mascara-800X800.webp" alt="" width="892" height="892"></p>
</div>
</div>
</div> 300g 300ml', 'Guerniss', 100.0, 0);
