INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (row_id, product_name, brand_name, size, manufactured_price, market_average_price, canonical_name) VALUES (119, 'Guerniss Soft Burnt Matte Makeup Holding lipstick (G101)', 'Guerniss', '3g', 870.0, 1450.0, 'Soft Burnt Matte Makeup Holding Lipstick G101');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (119, 'Guerniss Official', 1305.0, 'https://guerniss.com/products/soft-burnt-matte-lipstick', 'Soft Burnt Matte Makeup Holding Lipstick G101', 'Soft Burnt Matte Makeup Holding Lipstick G101 <h1>Guerniss Soft Burnt Matte Makeup Holding Lipstick</h1>
<p>is a premium matte lipstick that perfectly balances comfort and style.</p>
<p>It has been designed to provide a smooth matte finish while remaining gentle on your lips. This lipstick features a burnt tone inspired by earthy warm hues that reflect the timeless beauty of burnt sienna.</p>
<ul>
<li>Matte: Offers a sophisticated, non-shiny finish that feels elegant and refined.</li>
<li>Softness: Formulated to be soft and soothing on the lips without being too bold or harsh.</li>
<li>Burnt shade: Inspired by warm autumnal colors, delivering a deep, rich burnt sienna hue.</li>
</ul>
<p>Experience a rich autumnal mood with this soft matte lips effect. It’s ideal for transitioning your look throughout seasonal changes. Whether it’s fall or any other time of year, this lipstick captures a natural, warm feeling that complements all skin tones.</p>
<h2>Introducing Guerniss Soft Burnt</h2>
<p>We proudly present our ultimate soft burnt designed for a flawless autumnal glow. As crisp autumn air settles in, this lipstick reflects that magic on your lips. It allows you to experience the genuine warmth and charm that many other lipsticks miss.</p>
<p>Use this beautiful to express your individual style while embracing the essence of fall. It’s more than a color—it’s a feeling and an artistic statement.</p>
<h3>Features and Benefits</h3>
<ul>
<li>Color and finish: Delivers warm, earthy burnt sienna tones paired with an elegant matte finish.</li>
<li>Long-lasting wear: Designed to be the best long lasting lipstick, eliminating the need for frequent touch-ups.</li>
<li>Comfortable application: Unlike many, our formula is soft and hydrating, preventing dryness.</li>
<li>Versatility: Perfect for autumn but suitable for any event, season, or statement you desire.</li>
<li>Expression: Enhances your personal style with a stunning, soft matte finish every single time.</li>
</ul>
<p>Our Soft Burnt Lipstick is not just a typical lipstick but an essential piece in your beauty collection. It delivers bold, rich colors while maintaining a highly comfortable feel. The flaky, drying of the past are history. This lipstick glides on effortlessly with a velvety smooth texture keeping lips soft and hydrated.</p>
<h3>Why Choose Guerniss Soft Burnt Matte Makeup Holding Lipstick?</h3>
<p>As one of the best options on the market, this lipstick merges style with outstanding function. It delivers a deeply pigmented color that instantly transforms your look. Not only does it offer a perfect matte finish, but it also nourishes your lips with carefully chosen ingredients to keep them moisturized and healthy.</p>
<p>Unlike other long lasting lipsticks that can feel heavy, this lipstick stays light and comfortable throughout the day.</p>
<h3>Perfect Match for Your Lipstick Collection</h3>
<p>Whether you own a lipstick set or prefer a standout solo piece, this burnt is a must-have addition. Adding it to your lipstick palette brings a unique warm edge that works beautifully with all complexions. It complements other shades in your collection, making it an ideal choice for anyone who loves a versatile lipstick.</p>
<h3>Usage Instructions for Best Results</h3>
<p>Twist the tube open and apply 1-2mm of creamy lipstick directly to your lips. Start from the center and move outward for even coverage. For a more intense look, layer the product gently to build the perfect matte finish. It won’t crack or dry out your lips, making this lipstick ideal for long wear.</p>
<h2>The Science Behind Our Best Nude Lipsticks &amp; <a rel="noopener" href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DMSwlwepZEf/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==" target="_blank">Matte Lipstick</a> Formula</h2>
<p>Guerniss lipstick is crafted with nourishing ingredients such as beeswax and enriching oils that protect and soften your lips. This blend ensures your lips stay happy and healthy, even with all-day wear. Our formula stands out in the range of best nude lipsticks by offering a burnt tone that is subtle yet unforgettable.</p>
<h4>More Reasons to Love Guerniss Soft Burnt <a rel="noopener" title="" href="https://guerniss.com/products/babyes-velvet-matte-liquid-lipstick" target="_blank">Matte Lipstick</a>
</h4>
<ul>
<li>Cruelty-free, upholding ethical beauty standards without compromising quality.</li>
<li>Paraben-free and safe for daily use with gentle ingredients suitable for all skin types.</li>
<li>Truly lasts and stays on without feeling heavy or drying out your lips.</li>
</ul>
<p>Experience the luxurious feel of this, ideal for a stunning, natural look any time of the year. Add it to your beauty kit today for a perfect blend of comfort, color, and long-lasting wear you will love.</p> 3g 3ml', 'Guerniss', 100.0, 1);
