INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (128, 'Guerniss Official', 1683.0, 'https://guerniss.com/products/anti-melasma-toner', 'Anti Melasma Toner', 'Anti Melasma Toner <h1><strong>Anti Melasma Toner</strong></h1>
<p>Anti Melasma Toner, a skin care essential that leaves skin clear, bright, and smoother, eliminates melasma, hyperpigmentation, and stubborn dark spots. Formulated with a blend of powerful natural chemicals and antioxidants, this toner effectively balances your skin tone and reduces discoloration, giving you a radiant look that you’ll love.</p>
<h2><strong>Key Ingredients and Benefits:</strong></h2>
<p><strong>Vitamin C:</strong> Well-known for its antioxidant and brightening properties, Vitamin C reduces hyperpigmentation and lightens dark spots. It also improves overall skin health by protecting the skin from harmful radicals. Burdock extract, also known as Arctium lappa root extract, is an herbal extract with powerful anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties that helps heal and soothe the skin while also eliminating pigmentation and uneven skin tone.</p>
<p><strong>Calendula Officinalis Flower Extract:</strong> Calendula extract soothes skin irritation and reduces redness, leaving your skin feeling nourished and renewed thanks to its soothing and healing properties.</p>
<p><strong>Allantoin:</strong> Known for its ability to repair damaged skin, allantoin encourages the regeneration of skin cells, keeping your skin moisturized, smooth, and silky. It also helps reduce irritation and inflammation. Hedera Helix (ivy leaf/stem) Extract: Moreover, This plant extract detoxifies the skin, increases blood circulation, and addresses the root causes of pigmentation by creating a healthy appearance.</p>
<p><strong>Hydrolyzed Corn Starch:</strong> This ingredient prevents your skin from feeling greasy and makes it silky and smooth, while also hydrating and softening it. It gently exfoliates dead skin cells, increases skin turnover, and encourages the regeneration of new, healthy skin. In addition, The Anti Melasma Toner is designed to eliminate dark spots, uneven skin tone, and melasma. In addition to whitening hyperpigmented areas, the blend of natural extracts helps calm, balance, and nourish the skin. Regular use of this toner will make your skin brighter, reduce stubborn dark spots, and improve your skin tone.</p>
<h2>Why choose an anti-melasma toner?</h2>
<p><strong>Specific pigmentation therapy:</strong> A powerful combination of chemicals combats hyperpigmentation and melasma, leaving your skin naturally radiant.</p>
<p><strong>Calming, gentle formula:</strong> This toner is great for daily use as it soothes and hydrates sensitive skin.</p>
<p><strong>Absorbent:</strong> The toner ensures that your skin absorbs quickly, feeling nourished and renewed, without leaving any oily or sticky residue.</p>
<p><strong>Suitable for every skin type:</strong> This toner is designed to work well with any skin care regimen, whether you have dry, oily, or combination skin.</p>
<p>Moreover, Apply a small amount of Anti Melasma Toner to a cotton pad and gently pat onto your face and neck, avoiding the eye area, after washing your face. For best results, follow with your favorite serum and moisturizer. This powerful, plant-based toner will revolutionize your skincare regimen, brightening your complexion, balancing it, and restoring your natural radiance. With each application, reveal a radiant, smooth complexion.</p> 150g 150ml', 'Guerniss', 100.0, 1);
