<p><strong>What it does:</strong><br>Guerniss Anti-Melasma Toner is a gentle and effective facial toner that helps to brighten, even out skin tone, and reduce the appearance of melasma. It is formulated with a blend of natural ingredients, including:<br data-mce-fragment="1"><br data-mce-fragment="1"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Kojic Acid:</strong></span> A natural skin lightener that helps to inhibit the production of melanin, the pigment that causes dark spots.<br data-mce-fragment="1"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Arbutin:</strong> </span>A natural skin brightener that works synergistically with kojic acid to enhance its effectiveness.<br data-mce-fragment="1"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Niacinamide:</strong></span> A form of vitamin B3 that helps to brighten skin tone and reduce the appearance of hyperpigmentation.<br></p>
