<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tea tree oil is an essential oil. The other name of this oil is melaleuca oil. It comes from steaming the leaves of the Australian tea tree. Tea tree oil is also believed to be antibacterial and antifungal when applied topically.</span></p>
