<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tea tree oil helps in promoting healthy skin by soothing and healing a wide range of skin problems including acne, rashes, eczema, itchiness and inflammation. It is a wound healer for skin. Besides tea tree oil helps to heal wounds that are caused by bacteria.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">There is some research that shows that this ingredient also plays a role in treating Psoriasis.</span></p>
<h2><strong>Tea Tree Oil for hair</strong></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Applying tea tree oil on your scalp can </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">help prevent buildup of chemicals and dead skin. It promotes healthy hair. It helps to treat dandruff, dry and flaky scalp. It has antioxidant and antimicrobial properties that prevents scalp irritation and soothes the scalp.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Besides, tea tree oil can fight the flake-forming yeast and reduce the itchiness associated with dandruff.</span></p>
<h1><strong>Guerniss Tea Tree Oil Serum</strong></h1>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This product can be a game changer for you if you are suffering from both acne and dandruff. Tea tree oil serum can also reduce your cost of purchasing two separate products for skin and hair.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our serum can control excess sebum on your scalp and face. It also calms down your scalp irritation and acne inflammation. </span></p>
