<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Gets rid of dry scalp </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Does away with dandruff  </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Reverses hair fall  </span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Kills hair lice </span></li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>For Skin</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Treats Oily skin</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Helps with itchy skin</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">        </span>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Reduce  inflammation</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Treats </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">infections, cuts, and also wound-healing</span>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Treats acne and psoriasis             </span></li>
