INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (138, 'Guerniss Official', 1332.0, 'https://guerniss.com/products/anti-melasma-cream', 'Guerniss Anti Melasma Cream 30 ml', 'Guerniss Anti Melasma Cream 30 ml <p dir="ltr"><span><a href="https://guerniss.com/products/spotless-brightening-serum" target="_blank" title="" rel="noopener">Guerniss Anti Melasma Cream</a></span><span> is expertly formulated to treat hyperpigmentation deeply and effectively. This rich yet lightweight cream combines advanced ingredients such as Tranexamic Acid and Betaine Salicylate with brightening plant extracts. It helps fade dark spots and reduce melanin production visibly. It also prevents new discoloration from forming, making it one of the best treatment for melasma on face.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr">The formula is carefully balanced with hydrating and soothing agents that keep skin soft, supple, and healthy. It strengthens your skin barrier function to boost overall skin resilience. Whether you face stubborn pigmentation patches or uneven skin tone, this delivers a gentle yet powerful solution you can trust in your daily skincare routine.</p>
<h2 dir="ltr">Why Choose This Anti Melasma Cream?</h2>
<p dir="ltr">This product offers targeted and effective care for dark spots. Its blend of potent actives and nourishing ingredients shows visible improvements in clarity and skin texture. It is highly recommended for anyone dealing with this common skin concern, providing safe and effective results without causing harsh irritation or dryness.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr">Key Benefits :</h3>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1" dir="ltr">
<p role="presentation">Visibly reduces melasma, pigmentation, and dark spots for a brighter and more even complexion.</p>
</li>
<li aria-level="1" dir="ltr">
<p role="presentation">Hydrates and softens the skin to restore a smooth, healthy glow.</p>
</li>
<li aria-level="1" dir="ltr">
<p role="presentation">Prevents the formation of new discoloration by effectively regulating melanin synthesis.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="ltr">This formulation suits all skin types, including sensitive and melasma-prone skin. Its gentle nature ensures effective results without irritation, making it a very safe skincare regimen choice for those seeking treatment.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr">Powerful Ingredients Behind the Effectiveness </h3>
<p dir="ltr">Tranexamic Acid inhibits melanin production and helps break down existing pigmentation effectively. Paired with Betaine Salicylate, a mild exfoliant, it promotes cell turnover and brightens the skin’s surface. These potent actives synergize well with botanical brightening extracts to improve tone, clarity and skin texture.</p>
<p dir="ltr">Moisturizing components deeply nourish the skin while maintaining a strong skin barrier. This prevents damage and dryness commonly associated with pigmentation treatment. By keeping the skin hydrated and comfortable, this cream supports lasting clarity and radiance without sacrificing skin comfort.</p>
<h2 dir="ltr">How to Use</h2>
<p dir="ltr">Incorporate this product into your nighttime skincare routine for best results. After cleansing, apply a small amount of cream to clean, dry skin, focusing on areas affected by melasma and dark pigmentation. With regular use, the cream fades dark spots, evens skin tone, and prevents new discoloration from developing.</p>
<p dir="ltr">For a detailed, step-by-step visual guide, watch this <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/v/173HS6WMAb/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FACEBOOK VIDEO</a>. The tutorial shows how to use the cream effectively to maximize daily benefits for your skin.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr">Additional Points About Guerniss Anti Melasma Cream</h3>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1" dir="ltr">
<p role="presentation">The lightweight texture ensures it feels comfortable on the face without greasiness or heaviness.</p>
</li>
<li aria-level="1" dir="ltr">
<p role="presentation">Free from harsh chemicals and parabens, making it a clean and safe application for daily use.</p>
</li>
<li aria-level="1" dir="ltr">
<p role="presentation">It is carefully formulated as an anti melasma cica cream that soothes while brightening skin simultaneously.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="ltr">Many users share positive<strong> review</strong> praising the cream’s gentle yet efficient nature. It has become a trusted choice for those seeking effective pigmentation treatment without side effects. This cream remains one of the best options available in Bangladesh for melasma care.</p>
<p dir="ltr">Whether you aim to reduce stubborn hyperpigmentation or maintain a clear, even skin tone, this cream is highly regarded as a leading option for <em>melasma treatment</em>. The affordable adds to its appeal without compromising quality or results.</p>
<h2 dir="ltr">Important Information</h2>
<p dir="ltr">This formula was designed with safety in mind to minimize common side effects like redness, dryness, or irritation. People with very sensitive skin are advised to do a patch test before full use. Always follow directions carefully and avoid excessive sun exposure during treatment to prevent complications.</p>
<p dir="ltr">For optimal results on how to clear melasma fast, it is best to pair this Anti Melasma Cream with sun protection and a well-rounded skincare regimen. Proper care and prevention help you achieve the best possible outcomes in the shortest time.</p>
<p dir="ltr">In summary, it offers an advanced and effective solution for pigmentation concerns. Its carefully balanced ingredients work together to fade dark spots, inhibit melanin production, and deeply nourish skin. This cream is a valuable addition to your skincare routine for achieving a more radiant and even complexion every day.</p> 30g 30ml', 'Guerniss', 100.0, 1);
