<p><strong>How To Use</strong></p>
<p>Cleanse your face thoroughly. Take an appropriate amount of gel on your fingers or a spatula and gently massage it onto your face and neck in circular motions. It can be used along with a regular moisturizer. Before first use, it is highly recommended to do a patch test on a small area of skin to check for any reactions.<span data-sheets-root="1"></span></p>', 'Nature Beauty', 100.0, 0);
