<p><span data-sheets-root="1">Aqua, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Glycerin, Vitamin E, CAPB, CDEA, Sodium Chloride, Fatty Acid, Polyquaternium-10, Niacinamide, Apricot Scrub Beads, Disodium EDTA, Panthenol, Phenoxyethanol, DMDM Hydantoin, Triclosan, Colour, Flavour, etc.</span></p>
