INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (247, 'OhSoGo', 299.0, 'https://www.ohsogo.com/products/skin-cafe-100-natural-essential-oil-10ml-sweet-orange', 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Essential Oil (10ml) - Sweet Orange', 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Essential Oil (10ml) - Sweet Orange <style>#html-body [data-pb-style=HGXYMBG]{justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-position:left top;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-attachment:scroll}</style><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="HGXYMBG"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main">
<p><strong>What it is</strong> <br>Skin Cafe 100% Natural Sweet Orange Essential Oil is an absolutely pure essential oil extracted from the peel of the sweet orange. Its sweet and citrusy fragrance will instantly give a feeling of happiness and warmth. This essential oil has several benefits.</p>
<p>Skin Cafe 100% Natural Sweet Orange Essential Oil will nourish the dry, irritated and acne-prone skin, reduce under eye bags or puffiness and improve the texture of skin by promoting clarity, radiance and smoothness. In addition it can help to mitigate the side effects of makeup on the skin. It will help with hair growth as well. This oil will help to improve digestion and eliminate toxins from the body. The pleasant scent of this essential oil will give a calming and relaxing effect. This oil can also be used as both perfume and air freshener.</p>
<p><strong>What it does:</strong></p>
<p><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/skin-cafe-Sweet-Orange-02.png"></p>
<p><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/skin-cafe-Sweet-Orange-12.png"></p>
<p><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/skin-cafe-Sweet-Orange-13.png"></p>
<p><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/skin-cafe-Sweet-Orange-07.png"><br><strong>For Skin:</strong><br>All skin types, including oily, dry, and mixed skin, respond favorably to Skin Cafe 100% Natural Sweet Orange Essential Oil. In addition to keeping the skin balanced and removing excess sebum, it also helps to fight bacteria and repair the skin.<br>This sweet orange essential oil''s vitamin C content lightens blemishes and black spots.<br>It generates collagen and encourages healthy blood flow, both of which are crucial for preventing aging.<br>It assists in reducing puffiness and bags beneath the eyes.<br>This oil has the same advantages for your skin as it does for reducing tension and anxiety. Your skin will become calmer and it will aid in fading acne scars, blotchy spots, and redness.</p>
<p><strong>For Hair:</strong><br>On inflamed scalp, Skin Cafe 100% Natural Sweet Orange Essential Oil is calming. Since it has antibacterial and anti-inflammatory properties, it is ideal for people who frequently have scalp problems like dandruff.<br>Additionally, this oil works wonders to hydrate brittle hair. It gives the hair a shiny, smooth finish.<br>Vitamin C, which is crucial for hair growth, is infused into the hair by this oil.<br>By boosting growth and bolstering your roots, it also prevents hair loss.</p>
