INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (257, 'OhSoGo', 499.0, 'https://www.ohsogo.com/products/skin-cafe-hair-care-bogo-offer-2-biotin-shampoo-with-onion-extract-250ml-silky-tresses-moisturizing-conditioner-120ml', 'Skin Cafe Hair Care BOGO Offer 2 (Biotin Shampoo with Onion Extract - 250ml + Silky Tresses Moisturizing Conditioner - 120ml)', 'Skin Cafe Hair Care BOGO Offer 2 (Biotin Shampoo with Onion Extract - 250ml + Silky Tresses Moisturizing Conditioner - 120ml) <p><strong>Fight hair fall and lock in moisture a complete hair care duo in one great deal.</strong></p>
<p>The <strong>Skin Cafe Hair Care BOGO Offer 2</strong> brings together two powerful hair care essentials at an unbeatable price. Get the <strong>Skin Cafe End of Hair Fall Biotin Shampoo with Onion Extract 250ml</strong> and the <strong>Skin Cafe Silky Tresses Moisturizing Conditioner 120ml</strong> — a perfect pairing to tackle hair fall, boost growth, and leave hair smooth, shiny, and frizz-free.</p>
<p><strong>What’s Included</strong></p>
<p><strong>1. Skin Cafe End of Hair Fall Biotin Shampoo with Onion Extract (250ml)</strong></p>
<p>Fortified with biotin and onion extract  two clinically recognised ingredients for stimulating hair growth and reducing hair fall. This shampoo gently cleanses the scalp while nourishing hair from root to tip, leaving it feeling sleek, shiny, and smooth.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Reduces Hair Fall</strong>  Biotin and onion extract work together to minimise hair loss and prevent breakage.</li>
<li>
<strong>Boosts Hair Growth</strong>  Stimulates hair follicles to encourage thicker, denser-looking hair.</li>
<li>
<strong>Adds Moisture &amp; Shine</strong> Leaves hair hydrated, glossy, and manageable after every wash.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>2. Skin Cafe Silky Tresses Moisturizing Conditioner (120ml)</strong></p>
<p>Enriched with Argan Oil, Flower Oil, and Biotin, this conditioner deeply moisturises and adds sheen to hair, making it less frizzy and easier to manage.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Smooths &amp; Adds Shine</strong>  Leaves hair silky, glossy, and beautifully smooth.</li>
<li>
<strong>Tames Frizz &amp; Flyaways</strong>  Improves manageability for easier styling.</li>
<li>
<strong>Prevents Breakage &amp; Split Ends</strong>  Strengthens hair and reduces damage over time.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>How to Use</strong></p>
<p><strong>Shampoo:</strong> Apply to wet hair, lather gently from roots to ends, and rinse thoroughly. <strong>Conditioner:</strong> After shampooing, apply to mid-lengths and ends. Leave on for 1–2 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use regularly for best results.</p>
<p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes and mouth. In case of contact with eyes, rinse immediately. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place away from sunlight and heat.</p>
<p>Authentic product at best price in Bangladesh.</p> 500g 500ml', 'Skin Cafe', 77.37, 1);
