<p><strong>What it is:</strong></p>
<p><br>Rajkonna Multani Mati is entirely organic and natural. The decomposing volcanic ashes that make up this light-colored Multani mati. Rajkonna Multani Mati will improve the appearance of blemishes and acne scars, leaving your skin looking radiant and attractive. Your pores will be thoroughly cleaned, and blackheads and whiteheads will be removed. Regular use of this clay will aid in removing impurities and shedding dead skin cells, leaving your skin feeling revitalized and with a radiant complexion.</p>
<p><strong>What it does:</strong></p>
<p><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/Rajkonna-Multani-Mati-01.png"></p>
<p><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/Rajkonna-Multani-Mati-04.png"></p>
<p><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/Rajkonna-Multani-Mati-02.png"></p>
<p><br><strong>Removes excess oil:</strong> Rajkonna Multani Mati''s ability to absorb oil makes it useful against acne and hastens the healing process.<br><strong>Whiteheads and blackheads are removed:</strong> It aids in deep pore cleaning. therefore extracting whiteheads and blackheads.<br><strong>Removes blemishes and acne scars:</strong> Its skin-lightening characteristics can aid in the fading of scars and skin pigmentation to provide your skin with a glowing, natural appearance.<br>Removing dirt and dead skin cells from your skin, enhancing circulation, and enhancing the health and tone of your skin are all made possible by the mineral-rich food.</p>
<p>¬†</p>
<p><strong>Disclaimer</strong></p>
<p>For external use only.<br>A patch test is recommended.<br>If irritation occurs, stop using it.<br>Avoid direct contact with eyes and mouth.<br>In case of contact, rinse immediately.<br>Keep out of the reach of children.</p>
