<div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main">
<p><strong>What it is:<br></strong>Lilac Niacinamide Serum 5% is a lightweight, oil-free serum that helps improve the overall appearance of your skin. It is formulated with 5% niacinamide, which is a powerful multi-tasking ingredient that offers a wide range of benefits.</p>
<p><strong>What it does:<br></strong>Lilac Niacinamide Serum 5% is a lightweight, hydrating serum formulated with 5% niacinamide, a multi-tasking ingredient with several benefits for the skin. Here''s an overview:</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Minimizes pores:</strong></span> Niacinamide helps to regulate sebum production and reduce the appearance of enlarged pores.<br><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Improves uneven skin tone:</strong></span> Niacinamide helps to fade hyperpigmentation and brighten overall skin tone.<br><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Reduces redness and blotchiness:</strong></span> Niacinamide has anti-inflammatory properties that can help to soothe redness and irritation.<br><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Hydrates the skin:</strong></span> Sodium PCA and Hyaluronic Acid work together to deeply hydrate the skin and prevent dryness.<br><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Controls sebum production:</strong></span> Niacinamide helps to regulate sebum production, which can benefit oily and acne-prone skin.<br><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Minimizes the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles:</strong></span> Niacinamide promotes collagen production, which can help to improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.<br><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Promotes a healthy skin barrier:</strong></span> Niacinamide helps to strengthen the skin barrier and protect it from environmental damage.</p>
<p><strong>Side effects:<br></strong>Lilac Niacinamide Serum 5% is generally well-tolerated, but some people may experience mild side effects, such as itching, burning, or redness. If you experience any side effects, stop using the serum and consult with a doctor.</p>
<p><strong><img id="TFUP7EF" src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/LILAC-5-Niacinamide-Serum-01.png" width="542" height="542"></strong></p>
