<p><strong><img src="https://shop.shajgoj.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/LILAC-5-Niacinamide-Serum-03.png" width="548" height="548"><br></strong>Contains an optimal concentration of Niacinamide<br>Provides the perfect duo of Niacinamide &amp; Sodium PCA<br>Safe to be used by beginners of advanced skincare<br>Can be used during both day &amp; night<br>For all skin types<br>Benefits:</p>
<p>Helps to build keratin and makes the skin healthy<br>Minimizes redness and blotchiness<br>Minimizes the appearance of pores<br>Controls sebum production<br>Reduces acne and scars<br>Minimizes fine lines and wrinkles<br>Who can use LILAC 5% Niacinamide Serum?</p>
