INSERT OR REPLACE INTO marketplace_listings (row_id, channel_name, price, url, matched_title, size, seller, confidence, available) VALUES (280, 'OhSoGo', 790.0, 'https://www.ohsogo.com/products/lilac-brightening-serum-with-2-alpha-arbutin-and-1-kojic-acid-30ml', 'Lilac Brightening Serum With 2% Alpha Arbutin And 1% Kojic Acid (30ml)', 'Lilac Brightening Serum With 2% Alpha Arbutin And 1% Kojic Acid (30ml) <style><!--
#html-body [data-pb-style=CK0PHFN]{justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-position:left top;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-attachment:scroll}
--></style>
<div data-element="main" data-appearance="contained" data-content-type="row">
<div data-pb-style="CK0PHFN" data-element="inner" data-video-fallback-src="" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-loop="true" data-background-type="image" data-background-images="{}" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-enable-parallax="0">
<div data-element="main" data-appearance="default" data-content-type="text">
<p><strong>What it is:</strong></p>
<p>The Lilac Brightening Serum is enriched with 2% Alpha Arbutin and 1% Kojic Acid. This serum is formulated with two of the most potent skin lightening agents that can be used quite well together. Including both ingredients in your skincare regime will help eliminate skin hyperpigmentation faster and more effectively.</p>
<p><br><strong>What it does:</strong></p>
<p>Contains optimal concentration of Alpha-Arbutin and Kojic Acid<br>Formulated with potent skin-lightening agents<br>Safe to be used by beginners of advanced skincare<br>Can be used during both day and night time<br>Brightens skin tone<br>For all skin types</p>
<p><br><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>
<p>Brightens skin tone<br>Lightens dark spots<br>Anti-aging<br>Reduces Hyperpigmentation<br>Lightens visible sun damage<br>Helps even out skin tone<br>Who can use LILAC Brightening Serum-2% Alpha Arbutin and 1% Kojic Acid?</p>
<p>Men and women over the age of 20 can use this serum.<br>Beginners of advanced skincare can use this serum.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p>
<p><br><strong>Alpha Arbutin: </strong>Alpha arbutin works by inhibiting tyrosinase activity that limits the melanin production in your skin. Less tyrosine and less melanin lead to lesser pigmentation, dark spots, and a more even complexion. It reduces age spots, acne scars or post-blemish redness.</p>
<p><strong>Kojic Acid: </strong>Kojic acid''s primary use and benefit is to lighten visible sun damage, age spots, or scars. This can result in an anti-aging effect on the skin. In addition to skin-lightening effects, it also contains some antimicrobial properties.</p>
</div>
